title: "Indonesian Chest X-Ray Report Generation"
abstract: >-
  Fine-tuning MedGemma-1.5-4B and CheXOne with QLoRA to generate chest X-ray
  radiology reports in Indonesian, evaluated with Indonesian text metrics and
  ReXrank clinical metrics computed on ID-to-EN translations.
